# Template for .env at the repo root, which is gitignored (see the bare
# ".env" line in .gitignore). Copy this file to .env and fill in a real
# GitHub Personal Access Token for `pnpm deps:dry-run` / `pnpm deps:fix`
# (the dependabot-agent CLI - see dependabot-agent.config.json for its
# other settings, which are not secret and stay committed).
#
# dependabot-agent loads .env from the workspace root - the directory you
# run it in, which for the root-level "deps:*" package.json scripts is
# this repo root (also matches "workspaceRoot": "." in
# dependabot-agent.config.json).
#
# Token needs read access to this repo's Dependabot alerts:
#   - Classic PAT: the "security_events" scope (or broader "repo")
#   - Fine-grained PAT: "Dependabot alerts" repository permission, Read
# https://github.com/settings/personal-access-tokens

GITHUB_TOKEN=
